    { "type": "header", "content": "Hero" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hero_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "THE EXPEDITION PLAN" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "hero_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Stay 100% delusional until it works, because there is no Plan B for Planet Earth." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "hero_body", "label": "Body", "default": "Omawild is a conservation-led food brand, starting with specialty coffee. We're on a mission to turn everything we consume into a vehicle that funds ecological regeneration and conservation efforts across the world, because regenerative farming is the most direct way to protect natural ecosystems. Think of Omawild as the nature fund that everyone can easily invest in." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "hero_image", "label": "Hero photo" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hero_image_ph", "label": "Hero placeholder label", "default": "Drop hero photo: the crew outside, cups up" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "hero_sticker", "label": "Sticker", "default": "COFFEE IS THE\nGATEWAY DRUG\nTO NATURE" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "How we started" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "story_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "HOW WE STARTED" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "story_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Our story began in Bali." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "story_body", "label": "Body", "default": "It started during an expedition across Bali, in a season of change when little made sense except for the conservation work that kept calling us back to Indonesia." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Mission" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "mission_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "OUR MISSION" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "mission_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Food is conservation work" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "mission_pull", "label": "Pull quote", "default": "Food is fundamental to our survival. We depend on it daily, but most of our food is produced in ways that harm our planet, and ourselves." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "mission_body", "label": "Body", "default": "Food grown regeneratively heals. It actively restores and gives back, completing the circle of life. Regenerative agriculture is conservation on the ground, so we only buy from producers doing it." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Sourcing / ORS" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "ors_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "SOURCING CRITERIA" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "ors_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Regenerative producers have to pass the Omawild Regenerative Standard (ORS)" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "ors_body", "label": "Body", "default": "Skip the middleman. We work directly with each producer so we can exchange ideas, share what we learn, and thrive together." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "scale_eyebrow", "label": "Scale eyebrow", "default": "A NOTE ON SCALE" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "scale_body", "label": "Scale body", "default": "Fully regenerative crops are rare, and holding every product to our four ORS would make it very hard to grow. As we scale, we will consider partnering from farmers who are willing to transition to regenerative agriculture, and we support them through it. By then, products will carry one of two labels for full customer transparency." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "legend_1_label", "label": "Legend 1 label", "default": "REGENERATIVE" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "legend_1_body", "label": "Legend 1 body", "default": "Passes all four criteria." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "legend_2_label", "label": "Legend 2 label", "default": "IN TRANSITION" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "legend_2_body", "label": "Legend 2 body", "default": "Organic farmers committed to moving towards regenerative agriculture with an agreed plan we can also help support." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "legend_3_label", "label": "Legend 3 label", "default": "ORGANIC" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "legend_3_body", "label": "Legend 3 body", "default": "Organic farmers who grow without synthetic fertilisers, pesticides or herbicides." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Pantry" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pantry_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "THE OUTDOOR PANTRY" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "pantry_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Everything you'd find inside your backpack to keep the adventure going." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "pantry_body", "label": "Body", "default": "Our product roadmap at Omawild is built around a simple philosophy of clean and delicious food that keeps you energised throughout your adventures. Because more time spent outside means more connection to nature, and to the magic of being alive. And the more we love a place, the more we will want to protect it." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Goals" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "goals_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "MILESTONES" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "goals_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Shoot for the moon. Land among the stars." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "goals_body", "label": "Body", "default": "We're here for the journey, but also the destination." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_goal_details", "label": "Show milestone detail bullets", "default": true },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Help form" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "help_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "THIS IS WHERE YOU COME IN" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "help_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Fuel the expedition" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "help_lead", "label": "Lead", "default": "Let us know how you can help, and we'll bring the coffee." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "help_form_label", "label": "Form label", "default": "I CAN HELP WITH" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "help_form_hint", "label": "Form hint", "default": "Select all that applies" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "help_note_label", "label": "Note label", "default": "ANYTHING ELSE? (OPTIONAL)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "help_note_placeholder", "label": "Note placeholder", "default": "Who you know, what you have in mind, how you'd like to help" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "help_email_label", "label": "Email label", "default": "YOUR EMAIL" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "help_email_placeholder", "label": "Email placeholder", "default": "So we can reply" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "help_cta", "label": "CTA", "default": "Count me in" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "help_mailto", "label": "Mailto address", "default": "hello@omawild.com" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "help_success_heading", "label": "Success heading", "default": "You're on the crew list." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "help_success_body", "label": "Success body", "default": "Your email app should have opened with everything filled in. Hit send and we'll be in touch." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Nature fund model" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "model_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "THE NATURE FUND" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "model_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Every sip and bite is part of the circle of life" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "model_body", "label": "Body", "default": "One big loop that keeps on giving, aka. the circular economy. How is this not already mainstream bewilders us. We trust that you've come this far because you have the courage to stand by our mission, and the courage to stand up for all life on our beautiful planet." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Base Camp" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "basecamp_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "INVESTOR ACCESS ONLY" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "basecamp_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "The rest of the map is reserved for those going to Base Camp with us." },
    { "type": "html", "id": "basecamp_body", "label": "Body", "default": "As much as we are crazy, delusional and try to have fun along the way, we are serious business about Omawild and our mission to preserve ecological systems through the food we eat. Enter your base camp code to unlock the map. Or if you are new here and interested in advising or investing, <a href=\"mailto:invest@omawild.com\">please let us know</a>." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "basecamp_code_label", "label": "Code label", "default": "BASE CAMP CODE" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "basecamp_code_placeholder", "label": "Code placeholder", "default": "Your base camp code" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "basecamp_cta", "label": "CTA", "default": "Climb on" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Roads / filter / numbers" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "roads_eyebrow", "label": "Roads eyebrow", "default": "PATHS EXPLORED" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "roads_heading", "label": "Roads heading", "default": "What we ruled out" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "roads_body", "label": "Roads body", "default": "Before coffee there were many ideas. We share this to give you a full window into our worldview and what shapes Omawild. While we try to keep an open mind, we stand by our values so our brand stays true to what it sets out to be. What killed each one is now a rule." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "filter_eyebrow", "label": "Filter eyebrow", "default": "THE PRODUCT FILTER" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "filter_heading", "label": "Filter heading", "default": "Questions to check off before adding to our pantry" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "numbers_eyebrow", "label": "Numbers eyebrow", "default": "THE NUMBERS" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "numbers_heading", "label": "Numbers heading", "default": "What we've done. What we need." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "numbers_done_label", "label": "Done column label", "default": "WHAT WE'VE DONE" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "numbers_need_label", "label": "Need column label", "default": "WHAT WE NEED" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Number values are placeholders only ([NT$], [#]). Do not put confidential figures here until there is a real gate." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Founder" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "founder_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "ABOUT THE FOUNDER" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "founder_lead", "label": "Lead", "default": "Jenny Hsu spent a decade climbing the tech ladder, burnt out, and packed her life up into 18 boxes. Then she went to Bali to learn permaculture. She came back building a food brand around ecological restoration, because living with farmers and being closer to nature taught her how much the world and our planet can heal through harmony with nature." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "founder_body_1", "label": "Body 1", "default": "For Jenny, she gave up comfort in every sense of the word to start over, as a complete beginner, in a new country, and in a new industry with no credentials and no network. But quitting isn't really an option, because that means giving up on our future." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "founder_body_2", "label": "Body 2", "default": "Her case for food is simple: we eat it every day, and most of it is grown in ways that deplete the soil, biodiversity and ecosystems we all depend on. She also pushes back on the idea that regenerative farming is the expensive option. Conventional agriculture only looks cheap, she argues, because the cost to soil, water and farmers never shows up on the balance sheet." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "founder_link_1_label", "label": "Link 1 label", "default": "Read her interview with Day 1 →" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "founder_link_1_url", "label": "Link 1 URL" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "founder_link_2_label", "label": "Link 2 label", "default": "Listen to her podcast with SIT →" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "founder_link_2_url", "label": "Link 2 URL" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "founder_image", "label": "Founder photo" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "founder_image_ph", "label": "Founder placeholder", "default": "Drop photo: Jenny, outside" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Close" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "close_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Come on the expedition" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "close_body", "label": "Body", "default": "For retailers, workplaces, festivals, investors and builders." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "close_cta_label", "label": "CTA label", "default": "Talk partnerships" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "close_cta_link", "label": "CTA link" }
  ],
